{"4710690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Crawlers", "steam_appid": 4710690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5005430], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710690/extras/4da931d40360e3a89d995fa586021524.poster.avif?t=1788252052\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710690/extras/4da931d40360e3a89d995fa586021524.webm?t=1788252052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710690/extras/4da931d40360e3a89d995fa586021524.mp4?t=1788252052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crawl through a haunted mansion one room at a time in this first-person, turn-based roguelite deckbuilder where the dead won't stay down and the doors won't stay shut.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick through every bookcase, cupboard, and drawer for ammo, keys, and the trinkets nobody came back for. When something rotten shuffles into view, the fight plays out turn by turn, and the cards in your hand are the only thing standing between you and the floorboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710690/extras/3b2bb75eaac567dd61d35d1cc2ef5712.poster.avif?t=1788252052\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710690/extras/3b2bb75eaac567dd61d35d1cc2ef5712.webm?t=1788252052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710690/extras/3b2bb75eaac567dd61d35d1cc2ef5712.mp4?t=1788252052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a chance to build a new loadout. Upgrade your weapons, chain them into lethal combos, and adapt before the mansion finds a way to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710690/extras/f1cd983ab484db86500eeb69a13bea67.poster.avif?t=1788252052\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710690/extras/f1cd983ab484db86500eeb69a13bea67.webm?t=1788252052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710690/extras/f1cd983ab484db86500eeb69a13bea67.mp4?t=1788252052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to lock &amp; load ...and crawl for your life.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710690/extras/4da931d40360e3a89d995fa586021524.poster.avif?t=1788252052\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710690/extras/4da931d40360e3a89d995fa586021524.webm?t=1788252052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710690/extras/4da931d40360e3a89d995fa586021524.mp4?t=1788252052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crawl through a haunted mansion one room at a time in this first-person, turn-based roguelite deckbuilder where the dead won't stay down and the doors won't stay shut.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick th